  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>If a cadet receives the mango, then the time taken by the mango to fall and the cadet to reach there should be equal.</p><p>Time taken by mango to fall&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>h</mi></mrow><mi>g</mi></mfrac></msqrt></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>19</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math></p><p>Therefore, the distance of the cadet from the tree will be,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>v</mi><mi>t</mi></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>18</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math></p></blockquote>",
